          "end": 17.895999999999997,
          "duration": 17.496,
          "until": 18.545999999999996
        },
        {
          "say": "At the end of ten minutes, one supplied sample falls below the requirement. The trace fails this sample-based check. A declining rate alone does not diagnose thermal throttling. Correlate real measurements with device temperature, power, placement, clock behavior, ambient conditions, and competing work.\n",
          "start": 18.545999999999996,
          "end": 37.122,
          "duration": 18.576,
          "until": 37.821999999999996
        },
        {
          "say": "A second candidate's samples remain above the same line. That makes it a candidate for further testing. Measure between samples, run a representative duty cycle, and recheck answer quality. Lowering generation work or changing precision can improve device behavior while also changing what the user receives.\n",
