          "say": "The model becomes a versioned device dependency. Stage an update in an inactive slot while the approved bundle stays available. Our interrupted download fails the authenticated length and hash checks, so activation remains blocked. The old bundle continues serving rather than being overwritten by partial bytes.\n",
          "start": 0.4,
          "end": 19.936,
          "duration": 19.536,
          "until": 20.636
        },
        {
          "say": "The complete candidate passes manifest signature, artifact, version, and compatibility checks in this fixture. Activation starts a fresh session because state from different model bundles can be incompatible. Real release evidence must also cover tokenizer behavior, task quality, abstention, memory, sustained performance, and device families.\n",
          "start": 20.636,
          "end": 42.836,
          "duration": 22.2,
          "until": 43.486
        },
        {
          "say": "A failed health check triggers the permitted recovery to the previous approved bundle. Test interruption and recovery as carefully as the successful update. A focused local assistant becomes useful when its learned skill, supporting evidence, execution path, data policy, and device lifecycle continue to work together.\n",
          "start": 43.486,
          "end": 63.382,
          "duration": 19.896,
          "until": 64.182
        }
